{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "advisor_subject_record",
  "spec": ["advisors 11.4", "advisors 17.15"],
  "description": "A subject without a location writes u16 4, the byte 0, data1, data2 and a null reference; with a location: the byte 1, x, z, then data1, data2 and the object reference. Read back it has the location and the object; a version-3 record fails.",
